  FT["MY-H5626"] = {"id":"MY-H5626","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 405/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年价格管制与反暴利（最高价格核定）（第8号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 8) ORDER 2017","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 8) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Bilangan 8) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá tối đa) (số 8) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาสูงสุด) (ฉบับที่ 8) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Nomor 8) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA405","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2017_P.U.(A)405-2017_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 8) ORDER 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5626-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Maksimum) (No. 8) 2017.\n\n(2)  Perintah ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh dari 23 Disember 2017\nhingga 27 Disember 2017.\n\nHarga pengeluar maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H5626-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga pengeluar maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Pertama bagi Negeri-Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wil ayah-Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan dan\ndaerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga borong maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H5626-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Harga borong maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Kedua bagi Negeri -Negeri di Se menanjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan dan\ndaerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga runcit maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H5626-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Harga runcit maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatak an dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Ketiga bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan dan\ndaerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 8) ORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4 of the\nPrice Control and Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [Act 723], the Controller, with the approval\nof the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-12"};
